sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as matching_agent.py (LangGraph)
    participant C as MCP Client (MultiServerMCPClient)
    participant S as filesystem_mcp_server.py
    participant R as resumes/ (sandboxed FS)

    U->>A: last_user_message = "jd_01.txt"

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over A,S: Startup - tool discovery
    A->>C: get_tools()
    C->>S: JSON-RPC: tools/list
    S-->>C: [read_file, write_file, list_files, search_in_file, watch_directory, batch_process]
    C-->>A: LangChain Tool objects
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over A,R: Node: parse_jd
    A->>C: read_file_tool.ainvoke({text_file: "jd_01.txt"})
    C->>S: JSON-RPC: tools/call {name: "read_file", ...}
    S->>S: validate_path() - sandbox + extension check
    S->>R: open("jd_01.txt")
    R-->>S: file content
    S-->>C: {content, success: true, metadata}
    C-->>A: tool result (JD text)
    end

    A->>A: extract_requirements() (LLM call, no MCP)

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
    Note over A,R: Node: search_resumes
    A->>C: write_file_tool.ainvoke({filepath: "temp_jd.txt", content: jd_text})
    C->>S: JSON-RPC: tools/call {name: "write_file", ...}
    S->>R: write temp_jd.txt
    S-->>C: {success: true, filepath: "..."}
    C-->>A: resolved absolute path
    A->>A: match_resumes_to_job(temp_jd_path) (RAG search, non-MCP)
    end

    A->>A: generate_report(), final_recommendation() (LLM calls, no MCP)

    A-->>U: Top candidates + verdicts
    A->>U: human_feedback() loop (compare / explain / refine / end)